# Browser
# Spara's Adjudicators: "When this creature enters, target creature an opponent controls can't attack or block until your
# next turn." Bot1 exiles it for {2} on turn 3 to give its Island "{T}: Add {G}, {W}, or {U}" (never red) and casts it from
# exile at once, the Island adding the {G}. Its trigger targets Bot2's Llanowar Elves. That turn the Elves can't block
# Bot1's Basking Rootwalla (CR 509.1b), which Bot2's Ornithopter blocks instead; on turn 4 they can't attack (CR 508.1c), though the
# Ornithopter does. Bot1's next turn, turn 5, ends both, and on turn 6 the Elves attack. Since the Adjudicators was cast,
# the Island taps only for {U} again. In the browser, the Island shows the ability it was given, and the Elves say they
# can't attack or block until Bot1's next turn.

